If something does not work
Symptom	Likely cause	Fix
Sparkline shows long text	Data category not Image URL	Tabular Editor ▸ P5 Z1 Sparkline ▸ Data Category = ImageUrl ▸ Ctrl+S
"composite key" error on a visual	a measure reads a field parameter's label column	flag the measure name (the P5 ones read the Order column)
Z2 colours ignore growth	a Details field is in the treemap	version A must have Category only
H shows more than 8 bars	Top N filter added on the parameter	remove it; the measure does the top 8
B4 tile not amber on Include	selected-state fx not offered	fallback in §2 B4
C2 subtitle missing after a product click	interaction Z1 → C2 is None	§9: Z1 → C1–C3 = Filter
Error icon on a visual	a measure broke	EVALUATE FILTER(SELECTCOLUMNS(INFO.MEASURES(),"Measure",[Name],"Error",[ErrorMessage]),[State]<>1) and flag it
Visual > 2 s	—	flag the Performance analyzer list
